# Optional answer synthesis. Without these, the app still does the full
# upload -> embed -> retrieve pipeline; it just returns the matching passages
# instead of a written answer.
#
# To enable answers:  cp .env.example .env   and set TWO things below —
#   1) ANSWER_MODEL  = a provider-prefixed model id
#   2) the matching provider key
# then recreate the container:
#   docker compose up -d          (run from this apps/rag-demo directory)
#
# This file is git-ignored once copied to .env — never commit real keys.

# ---- pick ONE provider ----

# Anthropic (Claude):
# ANSWER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-4-8
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OpenAI:
# ANSWER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Google Gemini:
# ANSWER_MODEL=gemini/gemini-1.5-pro
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# AWS Bedrock (uses standard AWS credentials / IAM role):
# ANSWER_MODEL=bedrock/anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022-v2:0
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# AWS_REGION_NAME=us-east-1
